    {
      "game": "MENACE",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/19423/450x258/menace-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1787558400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/19423-buy-menace-pc-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-11c6394",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "super cool top down turn based RTS, think Xcom but with large squads, and the ability to field several tanks, armored cars and even mechs.\n\n\n\nthe game offers tons of customisation options for your units, and several unique squadleaders that provide a unit bonuses.\n\n\n\nthe story mode is still in development, so you will have to wait a bit to fully finnish the game, but the first chapter is fully playable, and you can keep playing skirmish battles after the current story part is complete"
    },
    {
      "game": "Crimson Desert Deluxe Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/21082/450x258/crimson-desert-deluxe-edition-pc-mac-steam-cover.jpg?v=1787558400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/21082-buy-crimson-desert-deluxe-edition-pc-mac-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-10829bc",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/24209174-1720295351.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "This game is so good, it gives me strong Red Dead Redemption 2 vibes.\n\nIt is one of those very rare games where I don't want to rush the story at all. I want to explore every corner, do everything I can find and\n\nbasically squeeze every last drop of content out of it."
    },
    {
      "game": "Total War: Pharaoh",
